From: "Lorenzo Stoakes (ARM)" <ljs@kernel.org>
Date: Thu, 5 Nov 2026 21:30:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mm/filemap: convert fault and readahead logic to use
 vma_flags_t
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Replace use of the legacy vm_flags_t flags with vma_flags_t values in the
file fault and mmap readahead logic.

No functional change intended.

Link: https://lore.kernel.org/20261105-late-2026-vma-flags-v1-2-0d3cd15ab75f@kernel.org
